BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Scavenger Hunt Tuesdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260526T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260526T235959
UID:69e12b261e64afd01e69a412@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us anytime of the day every Tuesday of the month\; try yo
 ur best to find all of the items hidden around the library’s children se
 ction each Tuesday. Find them all and win a fun prize!\nDrop in\, no regis
 tration required.\nLive or automated closed captioning\, sign language int
 erpretation\, intervenor services\, or attendant services are available up
 on request. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to:\ntp
 l.ca/accessibility-events\n.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe\, Children's Area
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e12b261e64afd01e69a412
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
