DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday come out to build\, create and use your imagin
 ation with LEGO. Enjoy a new building challenge each week. Complete 5 chal
 lenges and get a sticker! Drop-in.\nMarch Break Challenge: Build a mall as
  a group from 2-3pm\nIf you identify as a person with a disability and req
 uire an accessibility accommodation to participate in this program\, pleas
 e contact Accessibility Services by email\, accessibleservices@tpl.ca\, or
  voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please contact us at least 
 three weeks in advance.
LOCATION:Jones\, Children's Area
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a098a32866a5b4883e9166
