DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T153000
UID:69a30056491b809c6f1d1dc8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Let's watch the movie adaptation of the popular graphic book c
 haracter Dog Man!\nDescription: When a dog and a police officer are injur
 ed together on the job. A life-saving surgery changes the course of histor
 y when Dog Man is born. Half dog\, half man\, Dog Man is sworn to protect 
 and serve as long as he isn't distracted by squirrels\, as he doggedly pur
 sues his arch-nemesis: the feline supervillain Petey the Cat. But the riva
 lry between Dog Man and Petey is upended by the arrival of an adorable kit
 ten clone of Petey\, Lil Petey\, who changes the game for both of them.\nR
 ated G\, 2025\, duration: 89 minutes
LOCATION:Palmerston\, Theatre (downstairs)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a30056491b809c6f1d1dc8
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
