BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Appleseed Yoga: Yoga Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T120000
UID:69b43e7e8089f23c6761d866@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where we r
 ead stories and make them come alive with our bodies! Join Megan Snider\, 
 author and Founder of Appleseed Yoga for Kids as she delivers inspiring st
 ories and gets the whole family moving. Class begins and ends with song an
 d breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. Kids and
  families can sit quietly and listen\, do partial poses or make up their o
 wn\, following our lead. It's ALL yoga! No experience\, mats\, or material
 s required.\nDrop-in.\nUnfortunately\, we cannot accommodate any large gro
 ups/daycares for this program.\nIf you identify as a person with a disabil
 ity and require an accessibility accommodation to participate in this prog
 ram\, please contact Accessibility Services by email\, accessibleservices@
 tpl.ca\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please contact u
 s at least three weeks in advance.
LOCATION:Jones\, Children's Area
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69b43e7e8089f23c6761d866
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
