 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nSpiderman Across the Spiderverse\n
 Miles Morales\, Brooklyn's full-time\, friendly neighbourhood Spider-Man i
 s catapulted across the Multiverse\, where he encounters a team of Spider-
