DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T113000
UID:69d7e2fb24bd39b0b5e6e438@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Rainbow Storytime where we celebrate all
  children and families! This Storytime will include a range of inclusive b
 ooks\, stories\, songs and rhymes that foster acceptance\, embrace diversi
 ty\, and help get kids ready for reading! This program is suitable for chi
 ldren 5 years and under with a parent or caregiver.\nThis event is part of
  Toronto Public Library's ongoing Pride series. For 2SLGBTQ+ events\, read
 ing lists\, videos and more\, check out tpl.ca/pride.\nIf you or your chil
 d lives with a disability\, and requires an accessibility accommodation to
  participate in this program\, please contact Accessibility Services by em
 ail\, accessibleservices@tpl.ca\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a 
 request. Please contact us at least three weeks in advance.
LOCATION:Jones\, Children's Area
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d7e2fb24bd39b0b5e6e438
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
